rts, but also has the highest total score deduction in the Gymnasium due to his frequent eccentric behavior. Talk about extreme.<br>Campanella holds &quot;humans&quot; in high regard, and acts arrogantly around the inhuman and artificially intelligent R. However, many claim to have seen him chatting and playing around with R for no reason in particular.<br><br><br>Let's Plays Welcome!<br>We'd love to hear from you anytime at our official account<br>(  )",
